Z||000000||kslish||05-04-2001||12:52 AM||||Well not really a roller-coaster, more like falling off of a cliff.  First, I get laid off from my tech job last Friday as part of company-wide cutbacks.  Today I found out that my ex-girlfriend (who I dated for four years and am still hung up on) just got engaged to the guy she started dating after me (we broke up a while ago).  <P>Life sucks sometimes and I just had to vent to someone.  The 2000 or so people on this forum seemed like a good place to start...   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Ken S.<BR>||||reg||9
